    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "A youth club has 80 members. There are 10 more boys than girls. How many boys are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "45 boys.\n\nRemove the 10 extra boys, halve the remaining membership, then add the 10 boys back.",
      "worked": "Without the 10 extra boys, the numbers of boys and girls would be equal.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}80-10&=70\\\\70\\div2&=35\\\\35+10&=45\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 45 boys. Check: there are 35 girls, so the total is 80 and the difference is 10.",
